{
  "slug": "domain-check-skill",
  "name": "Domain Check Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Ask your AI coding agent if a domain is free — and get a real answer. Works for any TLD, including .de / .eu / .at / .ch where most checkers give up. Plugin for Claude Code. Pure Python, zero setup.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `domain-check` (Check domain availability (Available/Taken) for any TLD with confidence scoring, SSL certificate inspection, and IP resolution).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install domain-check-skill@claude-community` from `PleasePrompto/domain-check-skill`.\n\nAsk your coding agent \"is `example.com` free?\" and get an evidence-backed answer with the registrar, expiration date, server IPs, and full SSL certificate inline — for any TLD on the planet, including GDPR-redacted ccTLDs like `.de`, `.eu`, `.at`, `.ch`, `.es`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
